{
  "mn65:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 65 ",
  "mn65:0.2": "Bhaddālisutta ",
  "mn65:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn65:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn65:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "mn65:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "mn65:1.5": "“Bhadante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "mn65:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "mn65:2.1": "“Ahaṁ kho, bhikkhave, ekāsanabhojanaṁ bhuñjāmi; ",
  "mn65:2.2": "ekāsanabhojanaṁ kho, ahaṁ, bhikkhave, bhuñjamāno appābādhatañca sañjānāmi appātaṅkatañca lahuṭṭhānañca balañca phāsuvihārañca. ",
  "mn65:2.3": "Etha, tumhepi, bhikkhave, ekāsanabhojanaṁ bhuñjatha; ",
  "mn65:2.4": "ekāsanabhojanaṁ kho, bhikkhave, tumhepi bhuñjamānā appābādhatañca sañjānissatha appātaṅkatañca lahuṭṭhānañca balañca phāsuvihārañcā”ti. ",
  "mn65:3.1": "Evaṁ vutte, āyasmā bhaddāli bhagavantaṁ etadavoca: ",
  "mn65:3.2": "“ahaṁ kho, bhante, na ussahāmi ekāsanabhojanaṁ bhuñjituṁ; ",
  "mn65:3.3": "ekāsanabhojanañhi me, bhante, bhuñjato siyā kukkuccaṁ, siyā vippaṭisāro”ti. ",
  "mn65:4.1": "“Tena hi tvaṁ, bhaddāli, yattha nimantito assasi tattha ekadesaṁ bhuñjitvā ekadesaṁ nīharitvāpi bhuñjeyyāsi. ",
  "mn65:4.2": "Evampi kho tvaṁ, bhaddāli, bhuñjamāno ekāsano yāpessasī”ti. ",
  "mn65:4.3": "“Evampi kho ahaṁ, bhante, na ussahāmi bhuñjituṁ; ",
  "mn65:4.4": "evampi hi me, bhante